<title>BELGIUM: SGB H1 net rises to 6.72 billion bfr.</title>
<headline>SGB H1 net rises to 6.72 billion bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			6.72   vs  6.34</p>
<p>    Current profit		  6.31   vs  6.01</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain	    0.41   vs  0.33</p>
<p>NOTE - Societe Generale de Belgique (SGB) is Belgium's flagship holding company.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
